  "details": "The 2026.4.2 update is awesome, and Direct Arm Control is genuinely one of my favorite new features!\n\nHowever, I had access to it only once. After restarting VRChat, it disappeared, and I haven't been able to use it since.\n\nI understand that this is an experimental rollout, but it would be amazing if players who already got access could keep using it.\n\nPlease consider bringing it back or expanding the rollout. It's such a great feature, and I'd really love to use it again!\n\nThank you!",
